## Decode hex from Wireshark

```bash
echo -n '<hex>' | xxd -r -p; echo
echo -n '<base64 of c= value>' | base64 -d | xxd     # 24 B text + 32 B hash
```

Use `-r -p`. Pipe binary through `xxd` to avoid terminal garbling.
